# Domain

- Entities are plain classes named `*Entity` (`CatalogItemEntity`, `CartEntity`, `CartItemEntity`, `DeliveryEntity`, `PaymentEntity`, `DeliveryTimeEntity`). Mutable fields, required named constructors, camelCase (`cartId`, not `cart_id`).
- `CartItemEntity` has `id`, `cartId`, `catalogItemId`, `quantity`. `DeliveryEntity` and `PaymentEntity` link to a cart via `cartId`. `PaymentEntity` holds a saved-card `token` and `fulfilled` (false when created). A placed cart is the order: `placedAt` is set.
- No Freezed, Flutter, GraphQL, or GetIt types in `lib/domain`.
- Repository interfaces: `lib/domain/interfaces/repositories/i_*_repository.dart`, named `I*Repository`.
- Methods return `TaskEither<BaseFailure, T>`. CRUD:

```dart
TaskEither<BaseFailure, Unit> createCart(CartEntity entity);
TaskEither<BaseFailure, CartEntity> getCart(int id);
TaskEither<BaseFailure, List<CartEntity>> getCarts();
TaskEither<BaseFailure, CartEntity> updateCart(CartEntity entity);
TaskEither<BaseFailure, Unit> deleteCart(int id);
```

- Failures extend `BaseFailure` in `lib/domain/failures/`. Empty subclasses (no `==`); tests use `isA<GetCatalogItemFailure>()`. Auth: `InvalidEmailFailure` / `InvalidPasswordFailure`.
